---
/**
 * The Origin Cloud lockup: the pixel-cloud mark as inline SVG in currentColor
 * plus the wordmark as live text. Markup ported unchanged from the brand kit's
 * `brand` component (the brand kit's components/brand); the
 * solid mark, because the lockup sits below the raster minimum of 32 px.
 */
